  "final_message": "The complete RUSH-200 workflow has been executed successfully. Here is the full summary:\n\n---\n\n## RUSH-200 Production Plan \u2014 Applied (Revision 2)\n\n### Blockers Identified\n| Blocker Type | Resource | Required | Available | Shortage | Related Orders |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **Inventory Shortage** | THREAD-RED-40 | 1,200 units | 600 units | 600 units | \u2014 |\n| **Capacity Conflict** | EMB-01 (embroidery) | 10 hours | 8 hours | 2 hours | STANDARD-100 |\n\n### Displaced Work\n- **STANDARD-100** was scheduled on **EMB-01** for **2026-08-12** (6 hours). It has been **moved to 2026-08-13** to make room for the higher-priority RUSH-200 order.\n\n### Procurement Actions\n| Material | Quantity | Reason |\n|---|---|---|\n| THREAD-RED-40 | 600 units | Cover shortage for RUSH-200 |\n\n### Communication Drafts\n1. **Customer (RUSH-200):** *\"Your rush order has a proposed production slot pending material procurement.\"*\n2. **Operator:** *\"Schedule RUSH-200; move STANDARD-100 to 2026-08-13.\"*\n3. **Supplier:** *\"Please confirm availability for 600 units of THREAD-RED-40.\"*\n\n### Final Schedule\n| Order | Machine | Day | Duration | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| RUSH-200 (priority 100) | EMB-01 | 2026-08-12 | 4 hours | \u2705 Scheduled |\n| STANDARD-100 (priority 20) | EMB-01 | 2026-08-13 | 6 hours | \u21aa\ufe0f Displaced |\n\n### Applied Revision\n- **Proposal Hash:** `46d63343be0bbf98d2efa7d82bd6269cbf7b8c09401f52b7c73a76ec326685b5`\n- **Base Revision:** 1 \u2192 **Applied Revision:** 2\n- **Status:** \u2705 Applied\n\nThe plan is now live. The rush order RUSH-200 is scheduled for 2026-08-12 on EMB-01, pending procurement of 600 additional units of THREAD-RED-40. STANDARD-100 has been deferred to 2026-08-13.\n",
